{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/Banner.png?t=1741384074\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bet your own life in a poker dice game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit down to play poker dice against cheating deities. Whoeveer loses will be forced to shoot itself with a revolver... \u00bfwhat can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/UserShot.gif?t=1741384074\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Buy dice with powerful effects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+30 dice with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+7 cheating opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/BuyShop.gif?t=1741384074\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle against the Seven Deadly Sins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They won't play fair. You will have to find dice with powerful effects to combine them in order to create synergies. Otherwise, you won't be able to win them in their own game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/V\u00eddeo_sin_t\u00edtulo_\u2010_Hecho_con_Clipchamp_2.gif?t=1741384074\" /> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459890?t=1741384074","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/469c11d1a90b5c94b4ecb35360ce41683db635c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741384074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/debbbf3d034d5d605135877ced732d216eee9d91/cap